{
  "metadata": {
    "source": "NEXT062026_unlocked.xlsx, hidden sheet Dynamiques (rows 9-29, columns D/F linear, S/T logistic)",
    "inputs": {
      "time": "implementation length in years (named range time, Dynamiques!H3)",
      "time2": "capitalisation length in years (time2, H4); time_tot = time + time2",
      "x0": "value at t=0 (X0, O3)",
      "x_without": "end value of the without-project series (Xno, O4)",
      "x_with": "end value of the with-project series (Xyes, O5)"
    },
    "series": "Each series has one point per integer t = 0..time_tot (time_tot + 1 points). Point t is the state reached after t years, no half-year averaging. For t >= time the value is the end value.",
    "formulas": {
      "linear": "t >= time ? X1 : X0 + t * (X1 - X0) / time",
      "logistic": "t >= time ? X1 : X0 + (X1 - X0) * (1 / (1 + exp(-(10 / time) * (t - time / 2))) - 1 / (1 + exp(5)))",
      "logistic_notes": "Steepness k = 10 / time, midpoint time / 2. The 1 / (1 + exp(5)) offset makes X(0) == X0 exactly. The curve only reaches about 98.66% of (X1 - X0) just before t = time, then jumps to X1 at t = time.",
      "excel_linear_with": "=IF($C9>time_tot,NA(),IF($C9>=time,Xyes,X0+$C9*((Xyes-X0)/(time))))",
      "excel_logistic_with": "=IF($R9>time_tot,NA(),IF($R9>=time,Xyes,(X0-(((Xyes-X0)/(1+EXP(5)))))+((Xyes-X0)/(1+EXP(-(10/time)*($R9-(time/2)))))))"
    },
    "calc_sheet_usage": "Calculation sheets (e.g. Ag land row 26) inline the same formulas, picking L/S/E from a selector cell, with time = end_year - start_year and t = year - start_year + 1 (the start year already gets t = 1). Exponential (E) is not exported here.",
    "exact_comparison": "EX-ACT compute_yearly_or_half_year_cumulative(start, end, years_implementation, years_capitalization, fn, interim_values=False) returns the same time_tot + 1 points. With interim_values=True (the default) it returns average_yearly_value(points), the mean of consecutive points (mid-year values, time_tot items). Compare like with like: interim=False against the points, or interim=True against average_yearly_value(points)."
  },
